      <p begin="00:18.844" end="00:22.469" ttm:agent="v1">All white diamonds like a nigga racist, yeah, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:22.469" end="00:25.515" ttm:agent="v1">All white Audi somethin' like Sarah Palin, ya-ya, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:25.515" end="00:28.731" ttm:agent="v1">Rock out the show, collect the check, then I'm outta there</p>
