      <p begin="00:51.329" end="00:54.608" ttm:agent="v1">I just spent a dub, made it back, that shit wasn't nothin'</p>
      <p begin="00:54.608" end="00:57.881" ttm:agent="v1">Call of Duty guns, we got plenty of 'em</p>
      <p begin="00:57.881" end="01:00.880" ttm:agent="v1">I don't do one-on-one's, b***h, I'm plenty up</p>
      <p begin="01:00.880" end="01:04.279" ttm:agent="v1">Brought the fanny tucked in the club, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:04.279" end="01:06.799" ttm:agent="v1">I can't trust this ho, might set me up, yeah</p>
